drivers/video/nvidia/nvcursor.c, include/nvx/drivers/video/nvidia/nvcursor.h

The Turing hardware-cursor method numbers (HEAD_SET_CONTROL_CURSOR, HEAD_SET_CONTROL_CURSOR_COMPOSITION,
HEAD_SET_CONTEXT_DMA_CURSOR, HEAD_SET_OFFSET_CURSOR of class C37D/C57D; UPDATE and SET_CURSOR_HOT_SPOT_POINT_OUT
of class C37A/C57A), the method sequence and the cursor channel registers (channel 73 + head, 0x6104E0 control,
0x610664 status, 0x690000 user area) are taken from the Linux nouveau driver
(drivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/dispnv50/headc37d.c, cursc37a.c, nvkm/engine/disp/gv100.c,
include/nvhw/class/clc37a.h, clc37d.h), which is under the MIT licence:

